# Python bytecode. Generated whenever the engine is imported or the test suite
# runs, including in GitHub Actions. Machine-specific and worthless to anyone
# else, and IPS 9 makes this git history the desk's audit trail - it should
# contain research, state and trades, not build artifacts.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments, if anyone makes one locally.
.venv/
venv/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
